      "receiptId": "marinated-pilchards.html-1",
      "receiptSource": "The original source of this receipt isn\u0027t known. Can you help? \u003Ca href=\u0022mailto:editor@foodsofengland.co.uk?subject=Foods%20of%20England,%20Marinated%20Pilchards\u0022\u003E\u003Cb\u003Eeditor@foodsofengland.co.uk\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/a\u003E",
      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003ECornish Marinated Pilchards\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Cbr\u003E\n6 pilchards (or mackerel)\u003Cbr\u003E\n3 bay leaves\u003Cbr\u003E\n10 pepper corns\u003Cbr\u003E\n4 cloves\u003Cbr\u003E\n1 tsp brown sugar\u003Cbr\u003E\n1/4 pint cold tea\u003Cbr\u003E\n1/4 pint malt vinegar\u003Cbr\u003E\npinch of salt\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Cbr\u003E\nClean and fillet the fish, removing heads. Lay the fillets in a roomy dish. Combine the other ingredients and pour over the fish. Cook in a hot oven. Leave to cool.\u003Cbr\u003E"
    }
